 if s['status']=='RELEASED_AFTER_NUMERICAL_DECISION':body+=' The negative J2 bootstrap direction is consistent with the already-frozen J1 direction; this adds no new interpretation or modification of J1.'
 add('Final J2 bootstrap result if numerically valid',body)
 test_record=read(E/'test_summary.json') if (E/'test_summary.json').exists() else None
 testing=(f" Final A–T tests: {test_record['tests']}/{test_record['tests']} passed, zero failures/errors/skips." if test_record and test_record['passed'] else ' Final test receipt pending.')
 add('Stage 3J-R decision','**'+d['classification']+'**. The immutable acceptance record precedes release of any bootstrap distribution summary. Historical Stage 3J remains **EXECUTION FAIL**, unchanged. This stage concerns numerical reliability only; scientific sign or interval exclusion is not an acceptance criterion. The final test and build receipts verify preservation, exact samples, likelihood/scaling, all original gates, uniform execution and reproduction.'+testing)
 if s['status']=='RELEASED_AFTER_NUMERICAL_DECISION':body='The planned J2 bootstrap robustness uncertainty is now complete under the numerical remediation. J1 remains the primary association, with its original point estimate, CR1 covariance and player-bootstrap uncertainty unchanged. The planned numerical robustness package can be reported with this explicit remediation history; no historical failure is relabeled. No Stage 4 manuscript work was started.'
 else:body='J1 remains manuscript-usable as the primary association. The planned J2 bootstrap interval remains unavailable and should be reported as a numerical limitation or omitted from main robustness claims. This secondary limitation alone does not block the entire manuscript. No Stage 4 work was started.'
